# Two layer 7b effects set Ms. Marvel's base power, so the later timestamp wins (CR 613.4b, 613.7). Scale Up on turn 3 ("becomes a
# green Wurm with base power and toughness 6/4"): its cast triggers Ms. Marvel, whose grant is made when the trigger resolves, and
# Scale Up resolves after it, so she is a 6/4 although the hand holds two cards. Then Lightning Bolt at her (she survives, 4
# toughness) triggers again: the new grant is later than Scale Up's effect (CR 613.7a), so her base power is the hand, two cards,
# and the toughness Scale Up set stays 4.

